        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "You can also tell stories whose main characters are abstractions, even nominalizations. All things being equal, you should prefer concrete characters. But there are circumstances when a more abstract version of a story is better. These four sentences all convey the same message, but they do it at different levels of abstraction:",
